---
layout: base.njk
heading: Berlintreffen 2026
heroSubtitle: Freundschaft, Wettkampf und ein Wochenende im Freibad
heroImage: /images/news/startbloecke.jpeg
permalink: /berlintreffen/index.html
---

<div class="columns is-variable is-7">
  <aside class="column is-4-desktop" aria-labelledby="updates-heading">
    <div class="box">
      <h2 id="updates-heading" class="title is-5 mb-4">
        <span class="icon has-text-primary mr-2" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fas fa-bullhorn"></i></span>
        Updates
      </h2>

      {% for update in event_berlintreffen.updates | reverse %}
        {% if loop.index <= 3 %}
          <article class="media">
            <div class="media-content">
              <p class="is-size-7 has-text-grey mb-1">{{ update.label }}</p>
              <p class="has-text-weight-bold mb-2">{{ update.title }}</p>
              <p{% if update.link %} class="mb-3"{% endif %}>{{ update.text }}</p>
              {% if update.link %}
                <a
                  class="button {{ update.link.class }} is-small"
                  href="{{ update.link.url }}"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >
                  <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><i class="{{ update.link.icon }}"></i></span>
                  <span>{{ update.link.text }}</span>
                </a>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          </article>
          {% if loop.index < 3 and not loop.last %}<hr />{% endif %}
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </aside>

  <main class="column is-8-desktop">
    <div class="content is-medium">
      <p class="title is-3">Berlintreffen in Barnstorf</p>
      <p>
        Ende August begrüßen wir unsere Freundinnen und Freunde vom
        <strong>PSV Delphin Berlin</strong> wieder in Barnstorf. Gemeinsam
        verbringen wir ein Wochenende im Freizeitbad Hunteholz – mit Zelten,
        Vergleichswettkampf und einem abwechslungsreichen Rahmenprogramm.
      </p>

      <div class="columns is-multiline my-5">
        <div class="column is-half">
          <div class="notification is-primary is-light">
            <p class="is-size-7 has-text-weight-bold is-uppercase mb-2">Wann</p>
            <p class="has-text-weight-bold mb-1">28.–30. August 2026</p>
            <p>Freitag bis Sonntag</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="column is-half">
          <div class="notification is-info is-light">
            <p class="is-size-7 has-text-weight-bold is-uppercase mb-2">Wo</p>
            <p class="has-text-weight-bold mb-1">Freizeitbad Hunteholz</p>
            <p>Barnstorf</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="title is-4">Das erwartet euch</h2>
      <div class="columns is-multiline">
        <div class="column is-half">
          <p class="icon-text">
            <span class="icon has-text-primary"><i class="fas fa-campground"></i></span>
            <span>Zelten im Freibad</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="column is-half">
          <p class="icon-text">
            <span class="icon has-text-primary"><i class="fas fa-stopwatch"></i></span>
            <span>Vergleichswettkampf</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="column is-half">
          <p class="icon-text">
            <span class="icon has-text-primary"><i class="fas fa-users"></i></span>
            <span>Gemeinsames Rahmenprogramm</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="column is-half">
          <p class="icon-text">
            <span class="icon has-text-primary"><i class="fas fa-utensils"></i></span>
            <span>Grillabend mit Familien</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <article class="message is-info my-5">
        <div class="message-header">
          <p>Hinweis zum Wettkampf</p>
        </div>
        <div class="message-body">
          Für den Wettkampf kann maximal eine 100-m-Strecke gemeldet werden.
          Die Staffeln werden durch die Trainer zusammengestellt.
        </div>
      </article>

      <div class="buttons">
        <a
          class="button is-primary is-medium"
          href="https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzTwSpOi66D35blFEIvx6ax0DKcsHV3dyLcWY1WuSHV8wvbNFEkx0tvB0A5JNcorals/exec"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check"></i></span>
          <span>Zur Anmeldung</span>
        </a>
        <a class="button is-light is-medium" href="/verein/freundschaft-psv-delphin-berlin/">
          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i></span>
          <span>Hintergrund zur Freundschaft</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <section class="mt-6" aria-labelledby="zeitplan-heading">
        <h2 id="zeitplan-heading" class="title is-4">Zeitplan</h2>
        <div class="table-container">
          <table class="table is-fullwidth is-striped is-hoverable">
            {% for day in event_berlintreffen.schedule %}
              <tbody>
                <tr class="has-background-primary-light">
                  <th colspan="2" class="has-text-primary-dark">{{ day.day }}</th>
                </tr>
                {% for item in day.items %}
                  <tr>
                    <th style="width: 8rem;">{{ item.time }}</th>
                    <td>{{ item.activity }}</td>
                  </tr>
                {% endfor %}
              </tbody>
            {% endfor %}
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

</div>
